; ZilogWarnings.inc
;   This file gives symbolic names to the warning numbers generated by
;   Zilog assemblers, for possible use in the warning directive.
;
;   Syntax for the warning directive is
;
;       WARNING  <option><list> 
;         where <option> is one of
;            DISABLE:  Disable generation of the warning
;            ENABLE:   Enable generation of the warning
;            ERROR:    Treat the warning as an error
;            ONCE:     Generate the warning once then disable
;            SUPPRESS: Disable warning for next line only
;         and <list> is a comma separated list of warning numbers
;
;       WARNING PUSH    save the current state of all warnings
;       WARNING POP     restore the state from a previous push
;
;       WARNING "string" generates "string" as a warning
;
